WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
Standing heavy punch hits Ryu.

2
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.550
Heavy Vagabond Edge launches.

3
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.350
The OD air grab spends two Drive bars and slams Ryu.

4
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.450
Sprint launcher picks up the rebound.

5
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:05.950
Light Vagabond Edge finishes the juggle.

6
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:06.200
Ryu falls from the completed six-hit conversion.
